<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n96497" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στενό-πορος</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στειν-</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>with a narrow
			pass</i> or <i>outlet</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πύλαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					729
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔξοδοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Andr.</u>
					1143
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅρμοι Αὐλίδος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>IA</u>
					1497
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διὰ κυανέας ς. πέτρας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>IT</u>
					890
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκτή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lyc.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1405b36
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὦτα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.E.
					<u>P.</u>
					1.126
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				6.759
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			Subst.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στενόπορα</span>, 
				Ion.
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στειν-, τά</span>,
				<i>narrows</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				7.223
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ς. τῶν χωρίων</span>
			<i>defiles</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				7.73
			</span></i>: sg. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στενόπορον, τό</span>, <i>a strait, narrow</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				7.211
			</span></i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στειν-</span>), <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				4.6.9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ath.</u>
				2.13
			</span></i>.</div>
